      "content": "Understood, here's a focused approach:\n\n\"When addressing concerns about the incidences of dizziness, it's important to contextualize the data. First, explain that CardioZen is associated with a 5% higher incidence of mild dizziness, but it's imperative to note that this pales in comparison to the critical side effects reported in some competitors. Additionally, emphasize that our extensive post-market surveillance ensures that any elevated incidence is closely monitored and that our dosing recommendations can be adjusted accordingly to minimize such effects. Engage doctors by discussing our ongoing research aimed at reducing side effects, including dizziness. Furthermore, delve into our success stories where CardioZen, due to our personalized care strategies, led to significant improvements in cardiovascular health despite the small risk of dizziness, thus justifying its use in certain scenarios.\"",
